# A release checklist that names one reader of two

## The documentation matches what the build produces

Nothing decides this yet, and what is missing is a decision rather than a check.
The issue is #62.

The pages read against the tree on every run rather than trusted are
`docs/alpha.md`.

One name is right and the other page is missing, so a reader that refused every
backticked word would fail the equality here rather than pass this refusal.
